@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam maxMessageSize 180
skinparam wrapWidth 180
<style>
root {
  FontName Helvetica
  FontSize 14
  FontColor #1F2937
}
element { BackgroundColor #F1F5F9; LineColor #475569; LineThickness 1.2; RoundCorner 6 }
arrow   { LineColor #475569; LineThickness 1.2; FontSize 12; MaximumWidth 180 }
note    { BackgroundColor #FFF7E0; LineColor #B45309; FontSize 12; MaximumWidth 220 }
title   { FontSize 18; FontStyle bold }
caption { FontSize 12; FontColor #64748B }
legend  { FontSize 12; BackgroundColor white; LineColor #CBD5E1; MaximumWidth 320 }
.accent { BackgroundColor #1D4ED8; FontColor white; LineColor #1E3A8A }
.alert  { BackgroundColor #FEE2E2; FontColor #7F1D1D; LineColor #B91C1C }
.muted  { BackgroundColor #F8FAFC; FontColor #64748B; LineColor #CBD5E1 }
classDiagram {
  class { BackgroundColor #F8FAFC }
}
</style>
hide <<accent>> stereotype
hide <<alert>> stereotype
hide <<muted>> stereotype
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 50
skinparam ranksep 60

title UML class diagram: persisted municipal report data (JPA entities)
hide empty members
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

abstract class "User" as User {
  userId: Long {id}
  name: String {≤ 50}
  lastName: String {≤ 50}
  phoneNumber: String {≤ 20}
  role: String {discriminator}
}
class "Credentials" as Credentials <<dataType>> {
  email: String {unique, ≤ 100}
  password: String {≤ 100}
}
class "Citizen" as Citizen
class "MunicipalOperator" as MunicipalOperator

class "Report" as Report {
  reportId: Long {id}
  title: String {≤ 50}
  description: String {≤ 1000}
  category: ReportCategory
  reportDate: Date [0..1]
  attachedImage: String [0..1]
  currentStatus: ReportStatusValue
  citizenEditable: boolean
}
class "Location" as Location <<dataType>> {
  city: String {≤ 80}
  cap: String {≤ 5}
  street: String {≤ 100}
  streetNumber: String {≤ 10}
  municipalArea: String {≤ 80}
}
enum "ReportCategory" as ReportCategory {
  BROKEN_STREETLIGHT
  DAMAGED_ROAD
  ABANDONED_WASTE
  GENERAL_HAZARD
  DAMAGED_STREET_FURNITURE
}
enum "ReportStatusValue" as ReportStatusValue {
  submitted
  assigned
  in_progress
  resolved
}
class "StatusUpdate" as StatusUpdate {
  updateId: Long {id}
  updateDate: Timestamp
  newStatus: ReportStatusValue
}
class "InternalNote" as InternalNote {
  noteId: Long {id}
  text: String {≤ 1000}
  createdDate: Timestamp
}
class "Notification" as Notification {
  notificationId: Long {id}
  sentDate: Timestamp
  message: String {≤ 1000}
  notifiedStatus: ReportStatusValue {assigned or resolved only}
}

User *-right- "1" Credentials
User <|-- Citizen
User <|-- MunicipalOperator

Citizen "1" <-- "0..*" Report : reported by
MunicipalOperator "0..1" <-- "0..*" Report : assigned to
Report *-- "1" Location
Report "1" *-- "0..*" StatusUpdate : status history
Report "1" *-- "0..*" InternalNote : notes
Report "1" <-- "0..*" Notification : about
StatusUpdate "0..*" --> "1" MunicipalOperator : changed by
InternalNote "0..*" --> "1" MunicipalOperator : written by
Notification "0..*" ---> "1" Citizen : sent to


note bottom of Report
  Lifecycle rules in code:
  submitted -> assigned -> in_progress -> resolved.
  One StatusUpdate is written per change, and
  an operator must be assigned first.
  citizenEditable is true only while submitted.
  Status columns hold the stored strings of
  ReportStatusValue; state classes are not tables.
  Notifications are not cascaded: their report
  foreign key blocks deleting a report.
end note
note right of User
  Citizen and operator share one table
  (single table inheritance, column role).
end note
note bottom of Location
  Location columns are stored in the report table.
end note
note bottom of Credentials
  Credentials columns are stored in the users table.
end note
note as Dependents
  Dependents of this data: ReportService and
  UserService, through PersistenceService and
  JpaUtil (MySQL reports_db). Controllers and
  screens reach it only through them.
end note
legend bottom
  «dataType»: value part stored as columns of its owner's table.
  Black diamond: composition (status updates and notes are deleted with the report).
  Attributes without a multiplicity are mandatory.
endlegend
@enduml
